    "content": "#pragma once\n#include <FFat.h>\n\n// Fixed FAT layout selected for this CoreS3. Never format on a mount failure.\nnamespace localstorage {\ninline bool begin() { return FFat.begin(false, \"/ffat\", 2, \"ffat\"); }\ninline fs::FS& filesystem() { return FFat; }\n}\n"
