    "path": "lib/SimpleVox/src/simplevox.h",
    "description": "R13.4 / S08・SimpleVox v3・検証範囲は記録参照",
    "language": "cpp",
    "content": "// Minimal MFCC/DTW subset of SimpleVox; see LICENSE and REFERENCE.md.\n#pragma once\n#include \"utility/simplevox_mfcc.h\"\n#include \"utility/simplevox_dtw.h\"\n"
